# Layout since 0.6.0: one folder per addon (XayaUI, XayaUI_Chat, XayaUI_QoL, XayaUI_Bonus, XayaUI_Reskin, XayaUI_Options, plus the
# support folders XayaUI_Media and XayaUI_GameDump). Each folder is copied as-is into Interface\AddOns.

# Audio is NOT tracked: sounds from other sources carry their own terms and are kept out of the repository. Add your own files
# locally; see XayaUI/Media/Audio/README.md.
XayaUI/Media/Audio/*
!XayaUI/Media/Audio/README.md
!XayaUI/Media/Audio/Custom/
XayaUI/Media/Audio/Custom/*
!XayaUI/Media/Audio/Custom/.gitkeep
*.ogg
*.mp3
*.wav
# CC0 (public domain) sounds ARE tracked: Kenney "Interface Sounds" 1.0, see XayaUI/Media/Audio/CC0/CREDITS.md
!XayaUI/Media/Audio/CC0/
!XayaUI/Media/Audio/CC0/**

# editor / OS / backups
*.bak
*.orig
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
__pycache__/

# Extracted Blizzard UI art converted from Xaya's Iconography folder: personal use only
XayaUI/Media/Graphics/*
!XayaUI/Media/Graphics/README.md

# every cursor picture (Arrow, Fill_*, Ring*, CircleHD, HLRing_*) is part of XayaUI_QoL; other files in that folder (backups) stay local
XayaUI_QoL/Media/Cursor/*
!XayaUI_QoL/Media/Cursor/*.tga

# Claude Code handoff notes (local only)
CLAUDE-CODE-HANDOFF.md
HANDOFF-TO-CLAUDE-CODE-*.md

# Shelved QoL Elements (stat text boxes, cursor tracker + at-cursor reminders, buff bars, count support) live in shelved/: tracked
# for reference, loaded by no .toc. Bringing one back = moving it into the addon it belongs to and listing it in that .toc.
